caltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_9","text":"Truly remarkable.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_10","text":"This is a maneuver I could adopt for large-scale battles.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_11","text":"The most impressive part of this whole thing is that she was able to formulate that plan in such a short span of time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_12","text":"You seem to be enjoying this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_13","text":"How could I not be?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_14","text":"This is proof that Elysion's curriculum is doing its job.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_15","text":"But she claims not to trust me...","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_16","text":"Er, I mean the head of Elysion?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_17","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_18","text":"Yes,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_19","text":"that must be the reason.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_20","text":"It was bound to happen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_21","text":"Could this be karma?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_22","text":"What is going on?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_23","text":"Hear her out first,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_24","text":"and then decide for yourself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_25","text":"Decide what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_26","text":"You'll understand when you talk to her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_27","text":"We're currently pinpointing her location using the trajectory of her escape route.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1381_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"tacticaltitac","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1381_e_28","text":"I'll let you know once we have something, so stand by.","jump":null}],"chat":true}